    <h1>The Ultimate GSAP Book</h1>
    <div class="author">by Swaraj Singh</div>
    <p>GSAP (GreenSock Animation Platform) industry-standard JavaScript animation engine hai, jo 12 million se zyada live sites par use hota hai — Apple aur Google ke product pages se lekar Awwwards Site-of-the-Day winners tak. <strong>April 2025 mein, Webflow ne GreenSock ko acquire kar liya aur GSAP ko 100% free bana diya</strong> — har plugin jo pehle paid "Club GreenSock" membership maangta tha (ScrollTrigger, SplitText, MorphSVG, DrawSVG, Flip, ScrollSmoother, InertiaPlugin, aur bhi) ab ek simple <code>npm install gsap</code> ke saath free ship hota hai.</p>
  </div>

  <h1 class="part">Part 0 — Setup</h1>

  <h2>0.1 GSAP kya hai?</h2>
  <p>GSAP ek <strong>JavaScript animation engine</strong> hai, CSS framework nahi. Aap JavaScript likhte ho jo GSAP ko batati hai "is element ki is property ko, is value tak, itne duration mein, is ease ke saath animate karo" — aur baaki browser quirks, frame timing, math sab GSAP handle karta hai.</p>
  <div class="callout tip"><strong>Rule of thumb:</strong> simple hover states aur micro-interactions ke liye plain CSS use karo. Jab <em>sequencing</em>, <em>scroll-linking</em>, <em>SVG motion</em>, ya <em>fine-grained runtime control</em> chahiye ho, tab GSAP ka use karo.</div>

  <h3>2025 ka "GSAP ab free hai" story</h3>
  <p>Ek dashak se zyada time tak, GSAP ka core free tha lekin uske best plugins (ScrollTrigger, SplitText, MorphSVG, DrawSVG, Flip, ScrollSmoother, InertiaPlugin) ke liye paid <strong>Club GreenSock</strong> membership chahiye hoti thi. <strong>April 2025</strong> mein, Webflow ne GreenSock ko acquire karke paywall poori tarah hata diya — ab har plugin open <code>gsap</code> npm package mein bundle hai aur commercial use ke liye free hai. Agar koi purana tutorial mile jo "Business Green" license kharidne ko bole, use ignore kar do — woh step ab exist hi nahi karta.</p>

  <h2>0.2 GSAP Install Karna</h2>
  <p>Option A — CDN (sabse fast tareeka shuru karne ka)</p>
  <pre><code class="language-xml">&lt;script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/gsap@3.15/dist/gsap.min.js"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;script&gt;
  gsap.to(".box", { x: 300, rotation: 360, duration: 1 });
&lt;/script&gt;</code></pre>

  <p>Option B — npm (real projects ke liye recommended)</p>
  <pre><code class="language-bash">npm install gsap</code></pre>
  <pre><code class="language-javascript">import gsap from "gsap";

gsap.to(".box", { x: 300, duration: 1 });</code></pre>

  <p>Plugins individually import kiye jaate hain aur use se pehle ek baar <strong>register</strong> karna padta hai:</p>
  <pre><code class="language-javascript">import gsap from "gsap";
import { ScrollTrigger } from "gsap/ScrollTrigger";
import { SplitText } from "gsap/SplitText";
import { Flip } from "gsap/Flip";
import { Draggable } from "gsap/Draggable";

gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger, SplitText, Flip, Draggable);</code></pre>

