      <li>Ek pinned section (<code>pin: true</code>) banao jo <code>+=800</code> pixels scroll tak fixed rahe jabki ek image <code>scrub: 1</code> se 1 se 1.5 scale ho.</li>
      <li><code>ScrollTrigger.batch()</code> use karke 20 items ki list ko stagger-reveal karo.</li>
      <li>Kisi bhi upar ke example mein <code>markers: true</code> add karo aur describe karo lines kya represent karti hain.</li>
    </ol>
